@startuml Report_Live_And_Query_Sequence
title Report Service - Live SSE and Report Query Sequence

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber

actor Client
participant "gateway-service" as Gateway
participant "SseRoute\nreport-service" as SseRoute
participant "LiveExecutionTracker" as LiveTracker
database "Redis\nexecution:state:{id}" as Redis
participant "ReportRoute\nreport-service" as ReportRoute
participant "ReportAggregationService" as ReportService
database "Elasticsearch" as Elasticsearch

== Live execution tracking ==

Client -> Gateway : GET /api/reports/api/v1/executions/{executionId}/live?interval=1000
Gateway -> SseRoute : GET /api/v1/executions/{executionId}/live
SseRoute -> LiveTracker : track(executionId, intervalMs)

loop until terminal status
  LiveTracker -> Redis : get execution:state:{executionId}
  alt state exists
    Redis --> LiveTracker : state JSON
    LiveTracker --> SseRoute : emit state JSON
    SseRoute --> Client : SSE event execution-state
  else no state
    LiveTracker --> SseRoute : {status: NOT_FOUND}
    SseRoute --> Client : SSE event execution-state
  end
end

SseRoute --> Client : SSE event complete

note right of LiveTracker
  Terminal statuses in current code:
  PASSED, FAILED, ABORTED.
end note

== Historical report query ==

Client -> Gateway : GET /api/reports/api/v1/reports/{executionId}
Gateway -> ReportRoute : GET /api/v1/reports/{executionId}
ReportRoute -> ReportService : getReport(executionId)
ReportService -> Elasticsearch : findByExecutionId(executionId)
Elasticsearch --> ReportService : TestReport / null
alt found
  ReportRoute --> Client : 200 TestReport
else not found
  ReportRoute --> Client : 404 Report not found
end

== Search / analytics endpoints ==

Client -> Gateway : GET /api/reports/api/v1/reports/search?...\nGET /api/reports/api/v1/summary?...\nGET /api/reports/api/v1/trends/{testCaseId}\nGET /api/reports/api/v1/flaky-tests?...
Gateway -> ReportRoute : forwarded route
ReportRoute -> ReportService : search / getSummary / trend lookup
ReportService -> Elasticsearch : query indices
Elasticsearch --> ReportService : result set / aggregation
ReportRoute --> Client : JSON response

@enduml
